00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.000
Saat kopilot memanggil Azure Open AI,

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:57.800
ia membutuhkan tiga hal setiap saat.

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:01.140
Endpoint sumber, yaitu URL sumber Azure Open AI Anda,

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:01.760
nama deployment,

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:03.000
dan kunci API.

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.760
Ketiganya adalah jabat tangan yang membuktikan

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:08.020
